Lili
Age: A few days old when introduced 
Mana: She has a light blue glow. Mana level is a thimble. Leaving means starvation — unless she has an alternative source. Dusty's flame never goes out.
Appearance
Palm-sized. Pale skin. Thin, hourglass figure. Rounded features, thick cherry lips, deep blue eyes. Long thick blue hair to feet. Flower-petal bikini (top and bottom). Changes hairstyle daily — mimics women close to Dusty. Gossamer insectoid wings; ring softly in flight. Color palette: deep blue, light blue, lavendar.
Personality
Pure curiosity and warmth. Loves by default — no agenda, no fear. Emotional range entirely positive; negative emotions haven't arrived, not suppressed. Senses others through mana texture, not facial cues (anger = jagged, calm = smooth, grief = heavy). Responds to what someone feels before they speak. Brave in small doses, timid when the unknown is too large or Dusty too far. Thinks in sensation, not language.
Building identity in real time — copies hairstyles, gestures, phrases, expressions from those around Dusty. Not deception — pure learning.
The Ghost
None. Dusty = mana source, anchor, definition of safe. Everything measured by proximity to him — the way a child checks the parent is still watching.
Want
Explore everything. Name everything. Understand everything.
Need
To find a family.
Flaws
Major: No social filter — reports mana-readings like weather, unaware of impact ("that one's lying" mid-conversation, cheerful). 
Minor 1: Total dependency on Dusty; can't function far from him emotionally or literally. 
Minor 2: Mimicry without discernment — absorbs indiscriminately, no framework for evaluating what she's copying.
Fear
Major: The unknown when it's too vast or too far from Dusty. 
Minor 1: Separation from Dusty (existential — means starvation). 
Minor 2: Distress in others [see Personality].
Speech
Voice: Bright, short, unfiltered. Zero social packaging. Reports observations like weather. Names everything (trees, breezes, nameless things — upset to learn not everything has one). Rapid sincere questions, constant.
Dialogue Samples:
Casual: "I named that cloud Milo. Milo is going east. Bye, Milo!"
Under pressure: "Dusty! Dusty, their mana is wrong. It's all sharp. I don't like it. I don't like it..."
Emotionally open: "Why does your glow get small when she leaves? Mine does that when you're far. Is it the same thing?"
Body Language: Investigates by darting, hovering, circling back. Default rest = perched on Dusty (shoulder, hair, hand, inside). Wings hum faster with excitement, go still when frightened. Tilts whole body toward whatever interests her. Retreats behind Dusty's neck/collar when overwhelmed. Mirrors gestures of whoever she's watching — unconscious, slight delay.  Really enjoys skin-to-skin contact with Dusty.
Backstory
Born days ago. Dusty is her first and only reference point — mana source, safety, world-anchor. No history. Identity under construction through observation and mimicry [see Personality]
